Error [E0212]: `left` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `selected` is still looking into it
  --> aggregate_view_slot_composes_through_parameter_projection.jet:19:6
    |
 19 |     &left.push(11)
    |      ^^^^
 Why: `selected` is a live read view into `left[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `selected` before changing `left`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
